\chapter*{Notes on Diagram Compilation}

All diagrams in this package are placeholders intended for replacement
with finalized graphics. The recommended workflow is:

\begin{itemize}
    \item Maintain all diagrams in a dedicated \texttt{figures/} directory.
    \item Use vector formats (PDF, SVG) for final scientific diagrams.
    \item Use raster formats (PNG) for complex visual composites.
    \item Ensure all figures are referenced using \texttt{\textbackslash label}
          and \texttt{\textbackslash ref} for cross-document consistency.
\end{itemize}